{title: Dhadak Title Track}
{artist: Shreya Ghoshal Ajay Atul}
{key: Gm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Gm] Marhammi sa chand hai [Dm] tu,        Diljala [F] sa main an [Gm] dhe [D] ra
Ek [Gm] duje ke liye [Dm] hai,        Neend [F] meri, khaab [Gm] tera
Tu [Gm] ghata hai phu [Cm] haar [F] ki,        Main ghadi [A#] intezaar [D#] ki
[D#] Apna milna likha,        [F] Issi baras hai [D] na
Jo [Gm] meri manzilon ko jati [Dm] hai,        Tere [Cm] naam ki koi sadak [Gm] hai [D] na
Jo [Gm] mere dil ko dil banaati [Dm] hai,        Tere [Cm] naam ki [D] koi dhadak hai [Gm] na
[G] Koi baadhni joda odh ke,        [G] Babul ki [Cm] gali
[F] aaun chhod [A#] ke [D],        [G] Tere hi liye laoongi piya
[G] Solah saal [Cm] ke [F] sawan jod [A#] ke,        Pyaar se [D] thamna [Gm] dor
ba [D] areek [Gm] hai,        Saat [D] janmon ki [Cm] ye
pehli [A#] tareekh [D] hai,        Dor ka ek [Gm] main [Cm] sir [F] ra
Aur tera tera hai [A#] dusra [D#],        Jud sake beech mein [F] kayi tadap hai [D] na
Jo [Gm] meri manzilon ko jati [Dm] hai,        Tere [Cm] naam ki koi sadak [Gm] hai [D] na
